<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1 class="titulo"><span class="marca">Move It</span></h1>
    <p class="descripcion">
      Welcome to the Electric Vehicle Fleet Management System!
    </p>
    <nav class="nav-acciones">
      <a class="cta anim-scale" href="/reservar">Book a vehicle</a>
      <a class="cta anim-scale" href="/html/reservas.html">View bookings</a>
      <a class="cta anim-scale" href="/vehiculos">Manage vehicles</a>
      <% if (usuario && usuario.rol==="admin" ) { %>
        <a class="cta anim-scale" href="/usuario">View user list</a>
        <% } %>
    </nav>
  </section>

  <div class="slider">
    <div class="slide-track">
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/citroen-c4.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/ford-focus.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/zoe-electric.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/seat-leon.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/mercedes-clase-c.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/coche-familiar.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/fiat-500.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="slide">
        <img src="/images/opel-insignia.png" height="100" width="250" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="columnas-index">
    <section class="about">
      <h2>Who are we?</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Move It</strong> has been a leader in sustainable and flexible mobility since 2025.
        Our mission is to offer a simple, transparent, and accessible electric vehicle rental experience for all users.
      </p>
      <p>
        With a modern fleet and a real commitment to innovation, we guarantee efficient travel while respecting the
        environment.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="valores">
      <h2>Our values</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Sustainability:</strong> We promote mobility that takes care of the planet.</li>
        <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Our services and vehicles are inclusive and designed for everyone.</li>
        <li><strong>Continuous innovation:</strong> We apply cutting-edge technology for a better experience.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Clear pricing and friendly service, with no surprises.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="como-funciona">
      <h2>How does Move It work?</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Register on our platform in less than 2 minutes.</li>
        <li>Book the vehicle that best fits your needs.</li>
        <li>Pick up your car at your nearest Move It dealership, open 24 hours a day, every day of the week.</li>
        <li>Enjoy the ride and return the vehicle whenever you wish.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="faq">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>What do I need to rent?</summary>
        <p>You only need your ID card, a valid driver's license, and a credit or debit card for payment.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I charge the vehicles?</summary>
        <p>All our cars have access to Move It charging stations and compatible public networks.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is roadside assistance available?</summary>
        <p>Yes, we offer 24/7 roadside assistance across the entire country.</p>
      </details>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="info-movilidad">
    <h2>Nearby charging points</h2>
    <p class="info-movilidad-intro">
      Check your location, nearby charging points, and the closest Move It dealerships.
    </p>

    <div id="map" class="mapa-movilidad"></div>

    <div id="nearest-info" class="nearest-panel">
      <div class="nearest-item">
        <h3>Nearest charger</h3>
        <p id="nearest-charger">Calculating...</p>
      </div>
      <div class="nearest-item">
        <h3>Nearest dealership</h3>
        <p id="nearest-dealer">Calculating...</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="columnas-index">
    <section class="testimonios">
      <h2>Move It Experiences</h2>
      <blockquote>
        <p>“Fast, simple, and eco-friendly. I'll definitely use it again!”</p>
        <footer>— Ana G., regular customer</footer>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <p>“Finally, a company that truly cares about accessibility.”</p>
        <footer>— Pablo M., special education teacher</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="contacto">
      <h2>Contact and locations</h2>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> info@moveit.com</p>
      <p><strong>Phone:</strong> 900 123 456</p>
      <p><strong>Main offices:</strong> Madrid (HQ), Barcelona, Valencia, Seville</p>
    </section>
</main>
</div>

